<title>AUSTRIA: Euro to bring big savings for Austria - Finmin.</title>
<headline>Euro to bring big savings for Austria - Finmin.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Finance Minister Viktor Klima said on Wednesday the planned introduction of the European single currency would bring with it significant savings for the nation.</p>
<p>Klima said the introduction of the Euro would shave Austria's budget deficit by four percent, or bring in savings of 100 billion schillings, within the next 18 months.</p>
<p>The switchover will cost Austrian banks eight billion schillings, he said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 274</p>
</text>
